meta {
  name: Get all blogs
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/blogs?page=1&limit=25&search=
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 25
  search: 
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get All Blogs
  
  Retrieves a paginated list of all blog posts, ordered by date descending.
  
  ## Endpoint
  `GET /api/v1/blogs`
  
  ## Authorization
  None — this is a public endpoint.
  
  ## Query Parameters
  
  | Param   | Type   | Required | Default | Constraints    | Description                                        |
  | :------ | :----- | :------- | :------ | :------------- | :------------------------------------------------- |
  | page    | number | No       | 1       | Integer, ≥ 1   | The page number to retrieve.                       |
  | limit   | number | No       | 25      | Integer, 1–100 | Number of blog posts per page.                     |
  | orderBy | string | No       | desc    | `asc`, `desc`  | Sort direction (currently applied as date DESC).    |
  | search  | string | No       | —       | Trimmed        | Full-text search across `title` and `description`. |
  
  ## Success Response
  - **Status Code**: `200 OK`
  - **Body**:
    ```json
    {
      "success": true,
      "message": "Blogs found successfully",
      "data": [
        {
          "id": "uuid",
          "title": "Blog Title",
          "description": "Blog description or null",
          "documentUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
          "publicId": "Cedarrise Initiative/BLOG/...",
          "date": "2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
        }
      ],
      "meta": {
        "pagination": {
          "page": 1,
          "limit": 25,
          "totalPages": 3
        },
        "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
      }
    }
    ```
  
  ## Response Schema
  
  | Field                    | Type     | Nullable | Description                                |
  | :----------------------- | :------- | :------- | :----------------------------------------- |
  | data[].id                | uuid     | No       | Blog post primary key.                     |
  | data[].title             | string   | No       | Title of the blog post.                    |
  | data[].description       | string   | Yes      | Optional description text.                 |
  | data[].documentUrl       | string   | No       | Cloudinary URL of the uploaded document.   |
  | data[].publicId          | string   | No       | Cloudinary public ID for asset management. |
  | data[].date              | ISO 8601 | No       | Timestamp of blog creation (default: now). |
  | meta.pagination.page     | number   | No       | Current page number.                       |
  | meta.pagination.limit    | number   | No       | Items per page.                            |
  | meta.pagination.totalPages | number | No       | Total number of pages.                     |
  
  ## Error Responses
  - **400 Bad Request**: Validation failed (e.g., `page` or `limit` is not a valid integer, `limit` exceeds 100, `orderBy` is not `asc` or `desc`).
  
  ## Notes
  - Results are cached under `cedarrise:blogs:list:{page}:{limit}` with a 1-hour TTL.
  - When `search` is provided, results are **not cached** and are filtered using PostgreSQL full-text search (GIN index with weighted `tsvector` on `title` and `description`).
  - Default ordering is `date DESC`.
}
